        "language": "rongmei",
        "title": "He kaguang David khuang khou",
        "credits": {
          "translator": null,
          "editor": null
        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. He kaguang David khuang khou kasu banchuang,",
            "Nang ramthan gaimei5#^ nang rui dam lou e;",
            "Ai neilamei dui kamuat mei 5#^ kumma,",
            "Theimei duipang khou nang janta thuanku ni.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "He kaguang tuna nangjan thuanku ni,",
            "Kapumma nang dammei guai 5#^ le;",
            "Kaguang thuankumei khuan 5#^ kao o,",
            "Kandihmei neila ngam kandiu khang.",
            "",
            "2. Mei sumak pui hukhou 5#^ kaguang Jisu,",
            "Kajeih luangkei khang ja maknga luang kei lou;",
            "Pa thaina palou latuang khuan e thei mu,",
            "Kandih hei lung geimei maknga khangni e.",
            "",
            "3. Kaguang thou 5#^ cho bam khang damloumei 5#^,",
            "Daniel kumma aini tipma dingni;",
            "Kachak gaimei 5#^ le kajan thukmei 5#^,",
            "Rianramei 5#^ni ai rianrana sui ni.",
            "",
            "4. He Immanuel kandih kathan dammei,",
            "Kasan kadiat riatlou la tuangkhuan thei mu;",
            "Rianra khanga tat man ngam kanmei guai le,",
            "Kau kagun daipui ram khou kalun hou ni."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
